istoric club and can't wait to get started,\" he said in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1120, "end": 1245, "text": "\"The passion and energy of the Portsmouth fans is infectious, and I'm looking forward to contributing to the team's success.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1246, "end": 1441, "text": "According to sources close to the deal, Tugal was courted by several top clubs in Europe, but ultimately chose Portsmouth due to the club's rich history and commitment to developing young talent."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1442, "end": 1553, "text": "\"Ilker is a world-class player who will undoubtedly make an immediate impact on our team,\" said Portsmouth F.C."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1554, "end": 1579, "text": "chairman, Michael Eisner."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1580, "end": 1717, "text": "\"We're committed to building a squad that can compete at the highest level, and İlker's signing is a significant step in that direction.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1718, "end": 1868, "text": "Tugal's arrival is expected to be a major draw for fans, with ticket sales for Portsmouth's upcoming matches already experiencing a significant surge."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1869, "end": 1976, "text": "The club has announced that Tugal will make his debut on August 20th against Oxford United at Fratton Park."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1977, "end": 2009, "text": "In related news, Portsmouth F.C."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2010, "end": 2198, "text": "has reported a 25% increase in merchandise sales since the announcement of Tugal's signing, with the Turkish star's jersey already becoming the top-selling item in the club's online store."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id"